{"id":"n60486-1-12","stage":0,"title":"나이 · 年龄","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60486-1-12-1","ko":"네가 올해로 나이가 얼마지?","zh":"你今年多大了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올해로","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나이가","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마지?","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]}],"audio":"/audio/d66e7c2bc7f0c31fa006.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60486-1-12-2","ko":"이제 곧 서른이 됩니다.","zh":"马上就三十岁了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听